That double makes a huge difference against monsters not immune to it
but the monsters on the planes reverse the immunities of the monsters in
Gehenon.  If you want to use both that costs twice as many enchant
weapon scrools.  I would pick one of the Brands and enchant it heavily. 
From then on my crysknife would be a backup wield.

For a Healer I might end up with something like this -

melee wields
enchanted Frost Brand - most used once enchanted
enchanted crysknife - backup

alternate quivers
huge stack blessed enchanted darts - most used once stacked
"dozen" enchanted elven daggers - backup or additional

stratregic reserve
blessed unicorn horn

The advantage a healer has with darts is multifire and who little they
weigh.  Untrap all dart traps and slaughter all gnomes for their darts. 
Use cancellation to be able to merge the entire supply to a single stack
then bless, enchant and use them until expert.  It's the same method
used with arrows but without a bow.


